Package: sanora-base
Version: @SANORA_VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: base-files, gettext-base
Maintainer: SANORA OS contributors <bmeesss@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/bmeesss/SANORA-OS
Description: SANORA OS base identity, defaults and branding
 sanora-base provides SANORA OS release metadata, /etc defaults, KDE system
 defaults, original branding assets, Calamares branding and the sanora-info
 helper. It is deliberately small; later phases will split defaults, branding
 and system tooling into separate packages.
 .
 This is a development package for the 0.1.x milestone, not a release
 artifact. It overrides /etc/os-release via a dpkg-divert so that the SANORA
 identity is visible to systemd, SDDM and applications.
